ttps://api.github.com/users/Maxwell-Zhao/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"8d5b0d013066d87cfa13c025a2885869b64e9f13","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alibaba-damo-academy/RynnWorld-Latent/commits/8d5b0d013066d87cfa13c025a2885869b64e9f13","html_url":"https://github.com/alibaba-damo-academy/RynnWorld-Latent/commit/8d5b0d013066d87cfa13c025a2885869b64e9f13"}]},{"sha":"8d5b0d013066d87cfa13c025a2885869b64e9f13","node_id":"C_kwDOU8J2RtoAKDhkNWIwZDAxMzA2NmQ4N2NmYTEzYzAyNWEyODg1ODY5YjY0ZTlmMTM","commit":{"author":{"name":"Haoyu Zhao","email":"55451421+Maxwell-Zhao@users.noreply.github.com","date":"2026-10-06T16:22:17Z"},"committer":{"name":"Haoyu Zhao","email":"55451421+Maxwell-Zhao@users.noreply.github.com","date":"2026-10-06T16:22:17Z"},"message":"Fix downstream post-train to derive from the v3 (fps=None) recipe\n\nrynnworld_latent_edge_posttrain was a copy of _fullft, which pins dataset\nfps=10.0. But it warm-starts from a TRAINED film checkpoint, and the released\nweights are a v3 (fps=None) checkpoint whose manifest carries each record's real\nfps. Pinning 10.0 rescales the mRoPE timestep (24/fps) ~3x against the\nwarm-started weights -- the exact silent misalignment the _v3_fullft caveat\ndocuments. Derive _posttrain from _v3_fullft instead (fps=None); the node comment\nnotes overriding dataset.fps=10.0 when warm-starting from your own fps=10 stage-1\ncheckpoint.\n\nVerified: all three experiments compose through the train.py path with _posttrain\nnow fps=None, keys_to_skip_loading=['net_ema.'], keys_to_select=[].","tree":{"sha":"a05c9400da6f2a998e7e914f5720b9167107b1a8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alibaba-damo-academy/RynnWorld-Latent/git/trees/a05c9400da6f2a998e7e914f5720b9167107b1a8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alibaba-damo-academy/RynnWorld-Latent/git/commits/8d5b0d013066d87cfa13c025a2885869b64e9f13","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alibaba-damo-academy/RynnWorld-Latent/commits/8d5b0d013066d87cfa13c025a2885869b64e9f13","html_url":"https://github.com/alibaba-damo-academy/RynnWorld-Latent/commit/8d5b0d013066d87cfa13c025a2885869b64e9f13","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alibaba-damo-academy/RynnWorld-Latent/commits/8d5b0d013066d87cfa13c025a2885869b64e9f13/comments","author":{"login":"Maxwell-Zhao","id":55451421,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1NDUxNDIx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/55451421?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maxwell-Zhao","html_url":"https://github.com/Maxwell-Zhao","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maxwell-Zhao/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maxwell-Zhao/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maxwell-Zhao/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maxwell-Zhao/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maxwell-Zhao/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maxwell-Zhao/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maxwell-Zhao/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maxwell-Zhao/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maxwell-Zhao/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"Maxwell-Zhao","id":55451421,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1NDUxNDIx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/55451421?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maxwell-Zhao","html_url":"https://github.com/Maxwell-Zhao","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maxwell-Zhao/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maxwell-Zhao/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maxwell-Zhao/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maxwell-Zhao/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maxwell-Zhao/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maxwell-Zhao/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maxwell-Zhao/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maxwell-Zhao/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maxwell-Zhao/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"3f7a9dd8791bfd824fe915e5fbae22650bb45e32","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alibaba-damo-academy/RynnWorld-Latent/commits/3f7a9dd8791bfd824fe915e5fbae22650bb45e32","html_url":"https://github.com/alibaba-damo-academy/RynnWorld-Latent/commit/3f7a9dd8791bfd824fe915e5fbae22650bb45e32"}]},{"sha":"3f7a9dd8791bfd824fe915e5fbae22650bb45e32","node_id":"C_kwDOU8J2RtoAKDNmN2E5ZGQ4NzkxYmZkODI0ZmU5MTVlNWZiYWUyMjY1MGJiNDVlMzI","commit":{"author":{"name":"Haoyu Zhao","email":"55451421+Maxwell-Zhao@users.noreply.github.com","date":"2026-10-06T15:32:18Z"},"committer":{"name":"Haoyu Zhao","email":"55451421+Maxwell-Zhao@users.noreply.github.com","date":"2026-10-06T15:32:18Z"},"message":"Add generic downstream embodiment post-training + v3 (fps=None) recipe\n\nPorts the internal multi-embodiment post-training into a data-agnostic form so\nusers can adapt the released film checkpoint to their own embodiment, and adds\nthe v3 recipe the released weights were actually trained with. Config-only: no\ndataset, embodiment name, or provenance is shipped.\n\n- experiment_config.py: register two nodes off _fullft --\n  * rynnworld_latent_edge_manifest_v3_fullft: dataset fps=None (per-record real\n    fps drives the mRoPE 24/fps time step); reproduces the released v3 weights.\n  * rynnworld_latent_edge_posttrain: warm-start from a TRAINED film checkpoint,\n    keys_to_skip_loading narrowed to [\"net_ema.\"] so the trained action heads are\n    preserved (the from-base recipes drop them to zero-init against the Edge base).\n- configs/posttrain/downstream.toml: MANIFEST_DIR-driven template (lr 5e-5,\n  3000 iters), load_path=$BASE_CHECKPOINT_PATH; names no dataset/embodiment.\n- README: recipes table (+v3, +posttrain), a \"Downstream embodiment\n  post-training\" section, and the fps=None caveat (a manifest without a real\n  per-record fps silently misaligns the mRoPE timestep).\n\nVerified: all three experiments compose through the train.py path\n(config_helper.override) with the expected fps / keys_to_skip_loading /\nkeys_to_select; added content scanned clean of internal names/paths.","tree":{"sha":"885ddcbb30230dd6832474383c4a0417ea6eaea3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alibaba-damo-academy/RynnWorld-Latent/git/trees/885ddcbb30230dd6832474383c4a0417ea6eaea3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alibaba-damo-academy/RynnWorld-Latent/git/commits/3f7a9dd8791bfd824fe915e5fbae22650bb45e32","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alibaba-damo-academy/RynnWorld-Latent/commits/3f7a9dd8791bfd824fe915e5fbae22650bb45e32","html_url":"https://github.com/alibaba-damo-academy/RynnWorld-Latent/commit/3f7a9dd8791bfd824fe915e5fbae22650bb45e32","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alibaba-damo-academy/RynnWorld-Latent/commits/3f7a9dd8791bfd824fe915e5fbae22650bb45e32/comments","author":{"login":"Maxwell-Zhao","id":55451421,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1NDUxNDIx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/55451421?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maxwell-Zhao","html_url":"https://github.com/Maxwell-Zhao","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maxwell-Zhao/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maxwell-Zhao/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maxwell-Zhao/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maxwell-Zhao/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maxwell-Zhao/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maxwell-Zhao/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maxwell-Zhao/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maxwell-Zhao/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maxwell-Zhao/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"Maxwell-Zhao","id":55451421,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1NDUxNDIx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/55451421?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maxwell-Zhao","html_url":"https://github.com/Maxwell-Zhao","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maxwell-Zhao/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maxwell-Zhao/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maxwell-Zhao/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maxwell-Zhao/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maxwell-Zhao/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maxwell-Zhao/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maxwell-Zhao/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maxwell-Zhao/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maxwell-Zhao/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"91592a81a44b5db3a477f225d8d14b30fa334b71","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alibaba-damo-academy/RynnWorld-Latent/commits/91592a81a44b5db3a477f225d8d14b30fa334b71","html_url":"https://github.com/alibaba-damo-academy/RynnWorld-Latent/commit/91592a81a44b5db3a477f225d8d14b30fa334b71"}]},{"sha":"91592a81a44b5db3a477f225d8d14b30fa334b71","node_id":"C_kwDOU8J2RtoAKDkxNTkyYTgxYTQ0YjVkYjNhNDc3ZjIyNWQ4ZDE0YjMwZmEzMzRiNzE","commit":{"author":{"name":"Haoyu Zhao","email":"55451421+Maxwell-Zhao@users.noreply.github.com","date":"2026-10-06T10:05:12Z"},"committer":{"name":"Haoyu Zhao","email":"55451421+Maxwell-Zhao@users.noreply.github.com","date":"2026-10-06T10:05:12Z"},"message":"Fix loading of released safetensors weights; document download->inference\n\nThe published RynnWorld-Latent checkpoint ships as raw OmniMoTModel\nsafetensors (net.* regular + net_ema.* EMA). load_vfm_model only stripped a\nleading \"model.net.\" prefix, so every net.* key fell through as an \"extra\ncheckpoint key\" and was ignored -- the released weights could not be loaded\n(\"N required model parameter(s) not found\"). Strip a bare leading \"net.\" as\nwell; net_ema.* still does not match, so the regular weights load and the EMA\nmirrors are left out (matching --no-ema).\n\n- README: add a \"download released weights -> roll out\" path (HF/ModelScope\n  snapshot_download + film switches + --no-ema) and correct the --no-ema note\n  (required for safetensors; EMA-to-regular is a DCP-only path).\n- requirements.txt / pyproject.toml: raise the torch floor 2.4->2.7 -- the\n  base->DCP converter imports torch.distributed.checkpoint.hf_storage, native\n  only in >=2.7 (the torch_dcp_hf_backfill shim is NVIDIA-image-only) -- and\n  track torchvision >=0.22.\n\nVerified end-to-end on a fresh env (torch 2.10) against the HF-downloaded\nweights, run from this repo: load_vfm_model loads all 558 net.* tensors and\nrollout.py generates 3 clips at PSNR(gen,gt) 20.9-23.3 dB, above the\n15.2-22.4 dB static-first-frame baseline.","tree":{"sha":"8bacb19a1ee30cf619ae62f1592c51908bc826f2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alibaba-damo-academy/RynnWorld-Latent/git/trees/8bacb19a1ee30cf619ae62f1592c51908bc826f2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alibaba-damo-academy/RynnWorld-Latent/git/commits/91592a81a44b5db3a477f225d8d14b30fa334b71","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alibaba-damo-academy/RynnWorld-Latent/commits/91592a81a44b5db3a477f225d8d14b30fa334b71","html_url":"https://github.com/alibaba-damo-academy/RynnWorld-Latent/commit/91592a81a44b5db3a477f225d8d14b30fa334b71","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alibaba-damo-academy/RynnWorld-Latent/commits/91592a81a44b5db3a477f225d8d14b30fa334b71/comments","author":{"login":"Maxwell-Zhao","id":55451421,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1NDUxNDIx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/55451421?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maxwell-Zhao","html_url":"https://github.com/Maxwell-Zhao","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maxwell-Zhao/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maxwell-Zhao/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maxwell-Zhao/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maxwell-Zhao/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maxwell-Zhao/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maxwell-Zhao/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maxwell-Zhao/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maxwell-Zhao/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maxwell-Zhao/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"Maxwell-Zhao","id":55451421,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1NDUxNDIx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/55451421?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maxwell-Zhao","html_url":"https://github.com/Maxwell-Zhao","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maxwell-Zhao/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maxwell-Zhao/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maxwell-Zhao/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maxwell-Zhao/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maxwell-Zhao/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maxwell-Zhao/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maxwell-Zhao/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maxwell-Zhao/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maxwell-Zhao/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"ab9fca35506660d9df8a0df4b90adf4f94af2237","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alibaba-damo-academy/RynnWorld-Latent/commits/ab9fca35506660d9df8a0df4b90adf4f94af2237","html_url":"https://github.com/alibaba-damo-academy/RynnWorld-Latent/commit/ab9fca35506660d9df8a0df4b90adf4f94af2237"}]},{"sha":"ab9fca35506660d9df8a0df4b90adf4f94af2237","node_id":"C_kwDOU8J2RtoAKGFiOWZjYTM1NTA2NjYwZDlkZjhhMGRmNGI5MGFkZjRmOTRhZjIyMzc","commit":{"author":{"name":"Haoyu Zhao","email":"55451421+Maxwell-Zhao@users.noreply.github.com","date":"2026-10-05T11:33:29Z"},"committer":{"name":"Haoyu Zhao","email":"55451421+Maxwell-Zhao@users.noreply.github.com","date":"2026-10-05T11:33:29Z"},"message":"Add RynnWorld-Latent open-source release\n\nA cross-embodiment video world model conditioned on RynnLAM continuous latent\nactions, built on NVIDIA Cosmos3-Edge (3.37B) via the vendored cosmos-framework.\n\n- rynnworld_latent/: world-model package (film action-conditioning, manifest\n  dataset, Hydra recipes, inference helpers, SDPA/lerobot compat shims)\n- scripts/: single-node training launcher, DCP checkpoint conversion, rollout inference\n- examples/: cross-action-transfer and inpainted-first-frame demos\n- rynnlam/: bundled latent-action labeler (inference + dense labeling + evaluation)\n- data/: 3 bundled sample chunks so a fresh clone trains out of the box\n- configs/: full-parameter (edge_fullft) and single-GPU smoke (edge_manifest_local) recipes\n\nTrains and infers on a single node; checkpoints stay on the local filesystem\n(no cloud object store). Replaces the placeholder README with full docs.","tree":{"sha":"a2da87b29d524c16cd12aae5c34ae6cc180fac51","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alibaba-damo-academy/RynnWorld-Latent/git/trees/a2da87b29d524c16cd12aae5c34ae6cc180fac51"},"url":"https://api.github.com/re